[{"text": "The assembly will now hear an address by", "start": 0.48, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "His Excellency Ali Fali Al Zahedi, Prime", "start": 2.879, "duration": 7.201}, {"text": "Minister of the Republic of Iraq. I", "start": 7.2, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "request protocol to escort his", "start": 10.08, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "excellency and invite him to address the", "start": 12.0, "duration": 6.36}, {"text": "assembly.", "start": 15.36, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "In the name of Allah, the most gracious,", "start": 46.96, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "the most merciful.", "start": 48.8, "duration": 4.399}, {"text": ">> Mr. President of the United Nations", "start": 51.28, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "General Assembly.", "start": 53.199, "duration": 4.961}, {"text": "Your Excellency, the Secretary General", "start": 56.32, "duration": 5.48}, {"text": "of the United Nations.", "start": 58.16, "duration": 3.64}, {"text": "Excellencies,", "start": 63.84, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "esteemed ladies and gentlemen,", "start": 68.24, "duration": 3.96}, {"text": "peace be upon you and God's mercy and", "start": 72.96, "duration": 4.76}, {"text": "blessings.", "start": 74.72, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "It is with great honor and pride that I", "start": 78.08, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "stand before this international forum", "start": 81.439, "duration": 6.641}, {"text": "representing the Republic of Iraq,", "start": 83.84, "duration": 8.12}, {"text": "the home of the first civilizations", "start": 88.08, "duration": 3.88}, {"text": "and where writing and law were born", "start": 92.159, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "and one of the founding members of the", "start": 96.72, "duration": 5.079}, {"text": "United Nations.", "start": 98.479, "duration": 3.32}, {"text": "I stand here", "start": 109.439, "duration": 4.881}, {"text": "to renew my country's commitment to the", "start": 111.92, "duration": 4.879}, {"text": "United Nations charter and principles", "start": 114.32, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "and to present Iraq's vision for its", "start": 116.799, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "future, its region, and the world. At", "start": 119.04, "duration": 6.759}, {"text": "this critical juncture,", "start": 122.159, "duration": 3.64}, {"text": "Iraq,", "start": 126.88, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "perhaps more than others,", "start": 129.039, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "has experienced wars and the damage they", "start": 132.56, "duration": 5.319}, {"text": "cause.", "start": 134.879, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "We have lived through the conditions", "start": 138.0, "duration": 3.92}, {"text": "they create along with the siege and", "start": 139.52, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "terrorism imposed on us.", "start": 141.92, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "Our", "start": 144.8, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "people have paid a hefty price", "start": 146.72, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "and lost the lives of their children,", "start": 150.0, "duration": 3.76}, {"text": "their resources, and their development", "start": 152.08, "duration": 4.68}, {"text": "opportunities.", "start": 153.76, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "Despite these difficulties that have", "start": 159.12, "duration": 5.199}, {"text": "made our country over several decades an", "start": 161.12, "duration": 7.64}, {"text": "arena of war and conflict,", "start": 164.319, "duration": 4.441}, {"text": "today we are confidently presenting our", "start": 169.92, "duration": 6.319}, {"text": "vision for the future.", "start": 173.12, "duration": 3.119}, {"text": "Iraq aspires to exercise its influence", "start": 185.44, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "and have an impact as an effective", "start": 188.959, "duration": 7.401}, {"text": "economic power in the region", "start": 191.68, "duration": 4.68}, {"text": "and as a bridge for dialogue and", "start": 198.72, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "cooperation among the peoples of the", "start": 200.959, "duration": 4.721}, {"text": "region.", "start": 203.28, "duration": 2.4}, {"text": "Ladies and gentlemen,", "start": 207.519, "duration": 3.561}, {"text": "our vision at this stage", "start": 211.84, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "is based on our national will to restore", "start": 215.36, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "the sanctity of the law,", "start": 218.72, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "enhance state institutions", "start": 221.92, "duration": 7.8}, {"text": "and strengthen citizens trust in them.", "start": 225.04, "duration": 4.68}, {"text": "These are our governing priorities.", "start": 236.959, "duration": 4.36}, {"text": "We are striving to ensure that the state", "start": 241.76, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "is the ultimate decision maker in", "start": 244.48, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "matters of peace and war and that", "start": 246.56, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "weapons and tools of power", "start": 249.2, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "remain in the hands of its", "start": 252.08, "duration": 5.4}, {"text": "constitutional institutions.", "start": 253.76, "duration": 3.72}, {"text": "This is so that the law is the final", "start": 258.239, "duration": 5.121}, {"text": "authority and national interest is the", "start": 260.88, "duration": 5.48}, {"text": "compass.", "start": 263.36, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "Our implementation measures in this", "start": 267.84, "duration": 5.919}, {"text": "field are moving on track", "start": 270.08, "duration": 6.399}, {"text": "as they represent the basis for building", "start": 273.759, "duration": 5.521}, {"text": "a state based on institutions,", "start": 276.479, "duration": 6.28}, {"text": "protecting sovereignty,", "start": 279.28, "duration": 3.479}, {"text": "ensuring stability", "start": 283.44, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "and creating the environment necessary", "start": 286.8, "duration": 6.2}, {"text": "for development and investment.", "start": 288.96, "duration": 4.04}, {"text": "With the end of the international", "start": 299.759, "duration": 5.72}, {"text": "coalition's mission in Iraq,", "start": 301.28, "duration": 4.199}, {"text": "we are moving our relationship with our", "start": 305.52, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "strategic partners to a new phase.", "start": 307.759, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "Moving from military cooperation to", "start": 310.16, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "economic and development cooperation in", "start": 313.039, "duration": 7.801}, {"text": "service of our common interests.", "start": 316.4, "duration": 4.44}, {"text": "In this manner, we add to Iraq's victory", "start": 325.28, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "over terrorism a redouble determination", "start": 328.56, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "and momentum to finish building our", "start": 331.6, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "military and security capacities in", "start": 334.4, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "order to protect our country, our", "start": 337.36, "duration": 6.6}, {"text": "people, and our sovereignty.", "start": 339.68, "duration": 4.28}, {"text": "In order to sustain integration with our", "start": 352.639, "duration": 4.641}, {"text": "international friends,", "start": 355.039, "duration": 5.361}, {"text": "we call on all partners to exercise", "start": 357.28, "duration": 7.52}, {"text": "border control, address gaps, and remain", "start": 360.4, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "constantly vigilant in order to prevent", "start": 364.8, "duration": 5.119}, {"text": "the formation of an environment", "start": 367.68, "duration": 5.959}, {"text": "conducive to extremism.", "start": 369.919, "duration": 3.72}, {"text": "Ladies and gentlemen,", "start": 374.88, "duration": 3.56}, {"text": ">> in the context of institutional reform,", "start": 378.479, "duration": 6.641}, {"text": ">> our government is fighting a battle", "start": 382.96, "duration": 4.239}, {"text": "against corruption and for the", "start": 385.12, "duration": 5.96}, {"text": "protection of public funds.", "start": 387.199, "duration": 3.881}, {"text": "We are moving forward with sustainable", "start": 391.28, "duration": 5.359}, {"text": "core solutions in order to increase", "start": 393.759, "duration": 5.201}, {"text": "performance, efficiency, and improve", "start": 396.639, "duration": 5.801}, {"text": "providing services.", "start": 398.96, "duration": 3.48}, {"text": "We aim to build a strong state", "start": 410.96, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "and a diversified and modern economy", "start": 414.4, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "that keeps pace with global", "start": 417.52, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "technological and digital", "start": 420.0, "duration": 4.52}, {"text": "transformations.", "start": 421.52, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "And accordingly,", "start": 426.08, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "we are working to employ all successful", "start": 428.639, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "expertise and innovative experiences in", "start": 431.28, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "the world of economics, finance and", "start": 433.759, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "business", "start": 437.28, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "in service of a renaissance of economic", "start": 439.039, "duration": 8.0}, {"text": "and financial reform.", "start": 443.36, "duration": 5.839}, {"text": "We also do this to provide a safe", "start": 447.039, "duration": 5.201}, {"text": "environment for national and foreign", "start": 449.199, "duration": 6.041}, {"text": "investment.", "start": 452.24, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "This vision is based on the great", "start": 458.08, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "potential Iraq possesses", "start": 460.0, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "in terms of resources and investment", "start": 464.0, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "opportunities in the fields of energy,", "start": 466.4, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "industry, agriculture, transport and", "start": 469.28, "duration": 6.6}, {"text": "technology.", "start": 472.88, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "Not to mention Iraq's exceptional", "start": 480.56, "duration": 5.96}, {"text": "geographical location", "start": 482.8, "duration": 3.72}, {"text": "which connects its economy", "start": 490.479, "duration": 5.881}, {"text": "to the world.", "start": 492.96, "duration": 3.4}, {"text": "In this context,", "start": 496.479, "duration": 3.481}, {"text": "our vision aims to move Iraq to a stage", "start": 500.16, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "where it can be an effective production", "start": 503.199, "duration": 6.881}, {"text": "partner in the region by gradually", "start": 505.68, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "reducing the role of the rentier", "start": 510.08, "duration": 5.72}, {"text": "economy,", "start": 512.8, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "strengthening open market policies,", "start": 516.88, "duration": 4.519}, {"text": "developing production and export", "start": 522.56, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "capacities,", "start": 524.48, "duration": 2.88}, {"text": "and investing in infrastructure and", "start": 527.519, "duration": 5.0}, {"text": "services.", "start": 529.519, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "On this basis, we have developed the", "start": 540.08, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "appropriate road map to support the", "start": 542.24, "duration": 5.88}, {"text": "private sector.", "start": 544.8, "duration": 3.32}, {"text": ">> Provide the necessary legal, tax and", "start": 549.76, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "customs facilities and guarantees for", "start": 552.959, "duration": 7.801}, {"text": "the growth of business and foreign trade", "start": 555.6, "duration": 5.16}, {"text": "and build effective partnerships with", "start": 561.92, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "the global market to accelerate", "start": 563.839, "duration": 6.641}, {"text": "achieving sustainable development.", "start": 566.48, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "In the field of global energy,", "start": 572.24, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "Iraq's influence is prominent as our", "start": 575.44, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "government is adopting an ambitious", "start": 578.24, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "program to increase the production of", "start": 580.48, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "crude oil", "start": 583.44, "duration": 4.959}, {"text": "in a manner consistent with the size of", "start": 586.16, "duration": 6.04}, {"text": "our proven reserves.", "start": 588.399, "duration": 3.801}, {"text": "Our", "start": 592.64, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "government is also working to develop", "start": 596.0, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "gas fields and expand refining refining", "start": 598.32, "duration": 7.6}, {"text": "capacities and our capacities to produce", "start": 602.32, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "derivatives and we are also working to", "start": 605.92, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "improve our prochemical industry", "start": 609.36, "duration": 4.719}, {"text": "capacities.", "start": 611.92, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "Our ambition is for Iraq to be a global", "start": 614.079, "duration": 5.921}, {"text": "hub for energy production", "start": 616.8, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "and to leverage its potential to promote", "start": 620.0, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "regional and international security and", "start": 622.32, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "stability in a sustainable manner.", "start": 624.88, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "Nevertheless, we express concern", "start": 627.839, "duration": 5.361}, {"text": "regarding developments concerned with", "start": 630.64, "duration": 5.199}, {"text": "freedom of transport and maritime", "start": 633.2, "duration": 5.639}, {"text": "navigation", "start": 635.839, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "and the crisis this has caused in terms", "start": 638.959, "duration": 6.841}, {"text": "of the rise of global energy prices.", "start": 641.279, "duration": 4.521}, {"text": "In order to contain the subsequent risks", "start": 650.8, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "and the consequences on our peoples, we", "start": 652.959, "duration": 6.241}, {"text": "are working to diversify our oil export", "start": 656.0, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "ports and develop energy lines and", "start": 659.2, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "corridors linking Iraq, Turkey, Jordan,", "start": 661.68, "duration": 7.0}, {"text": "and Syria", "start": 665.36, "duration": 3.32}, {"text": "in order to reach global markets with", "start": 670.32, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "the aim of contributing to energy", "start": 672.399, "duration": 6.721}, {"text": "security and diversifying supply routes.", "start": 674.72, "duration": 7.4}, {"text": "Excellencies,", "start": 679.12, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "economic diversification", "start": 686.56, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "on the basis of genuine partnerships", "start": 689.6, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "is a central strategic objective of our", "start": 692.56, "duration": 6.68}, {"text": "economic policy.", "start": 695.76, "duration": 3.48}, {"text": "Therefore,", "start": 703.12, "duration": 3.279}, {"text": "our government has set among its", "start": 704.64, "duration": 3.52}, {"text": "priorities", "start": 706.399, "duration": 4.481}, {"text": "the goal of promoting economic and", "start": 708.16, "duration": 7.4}, {"text": "industrial development in all fields.", "start": 710.88, "duration": 4.68}, {"text": "The development road project", "start": 718.399, "duration": 7.521}, {"text": "comes as Iraq's comprehensive vision for", "start": 722.64, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "regional complimentarity, integration,", "start": 725.92, "duration": 6.2}, {"text": "and stability.", "start": 728.88, "duration": 3.24}, {"text": "It represents a vital gateway and a", "start": 732.639, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "strategic corridor for trade,", "start": 735.44, "duration": 6.079}, {"text": "investment, industry, and energy,", "start": 737.839, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "connecting the east with the west.", "start": 741.519, "duration": 7.201}, {"text": "starting from the Grand Alfa port", "start": 744.399, "duration": 9.401}, {"text": "to Turkey and from there onto Europe.", "start": 748.72, "duration": 5.08}, {"text": "We want for this project to be open to", "start": 761.12, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "partnership with all our neighbors and", "start": 763.279, "duration": 4.081}, {"text": "friends", "start": 765.36, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "because we believe that economic", "start": 767.36, "duration": 6.279}, {"text": "interests create prosperity.", "start": 769.44, "duration": 4.199}, {"text": "When the countries of the region are", "start": 773.68, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "connected through ports, railways, power", "start": 775.279, "duration": 7.281}, {"text": "lines, trade and investments,", "start": 779.12, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "they have a greater interest in", "start": 782.56, "duration": 6.279}, {"text": "preserving stability.", "start": 785.04, "duration": 3.799}, {"text": "Here from the United Nations, we say to", "start": 791.04, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "the world,", "start": 793.12, "duration": 6.719}, {"text": "invest with Iraq.", "start": 796.24, "duration": 7.44}, {"text": "Iraq has resources, markets,", "start": 799.839, "duration": 6.641}, {"text": "a good location", "start": 803.68, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "and the necessary will to build a new", "start": 806.48, "duration": 6.44}, {"text": "economy.", "start": 809.92, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "Our government is hard at work to", "start": 817.44, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "develop mutually beneficial", "start": 820.399, "duration": 5.321}, {"text": "partnerships,", "start": 822.72, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "create employment opportunities,", "start": 826.32, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "transfer technology and knowledge,", "start": 829.839, "duration": 4.881}, {"text": "and develop Iraq's productive", "start": 833.04, "duration": 4.68}, {"text": "capabilities.", "start": 834.72, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": ">> Ladies and gentlemen,", "start": 838.639, "duration": 3.56}, {"text": "the security of states and the", "start": 842.48, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "maintenance of peace", "start": 844.399, "duration": 6.041}, {"text": "are a shared responsibility", "start": 846.72, "duration": 3.72}, {"text": "as per the charter of the United", "start": 851.04, "duration": 3.68}, {"text": "Nations.", "start": 852.48, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "True stability is not built through", "start": 854.72, "duration": 4.479}, {"text": "wars, but through common interests that", "start": 856.48, "duration": 4.799}, {"text": "make cooperation more feasible than", "start": 859.199, "duration": 5.08}, {"text": "conflict.", "start": 861.279, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "Iraq's vision is based on contributing", "start": 874.16, "duration": 5.119}, {"text": "to the region's transition from conflict", "start": 877.04, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "to integration, from competition to", "start": 879.279, "duration": 4.481}, {"text": "cooperation,", "start": 882.16, "duration": 4.479}, {"text": "from resource depletion", "start": 883.76, "duration": 7.079}, {"text": "to investment in development.", "start": 886.639, "duration": 4.2}, {"text": "On this occasion, we extend our hands to", "start": 891.04, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "everyone on the basis of respect for", "start": 893.68, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "sovereignty, non-inference,", "start": 895.76, "duration": 4.879}, {"text": "good neighborliness, strengthening", "start": 898.32, "duration": 5.759}, {"text": "mutual interests, and adopting dialogue", "start": 900.639, "duration": 7.56}, {"text": "as a means to address differences.", "start": 904.079, "duration": 4.12}, {"text": "Based on these principles, Iraq renews", "start": 909.36, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "its position in support of dialogue and", "start": 911.6, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "diplomacy", "start": 914.48, "duration": 6.44}, {"text": "to diffuse any crisis.", "start": 916.24, "duration": 4.68}, {"text": "We also call for support for efforts for", "start": 934.88, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "the passage of trade through Iraqi", "start": 937.76, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "territory with great facilities in order", "start": 940.0, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "to provide alternatives to complex trade", "start": 942.72, "duration": 5.96}, {"text": "corridors.", "start": 945.68, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "Ladies and gentlemen,", "start": 951.759, "duration": 3.561}, {"text": "Iraq believes that our responsibility", "start": 958.0, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "towards the people's their security and", "start": 960.399, "duration": 5.281}, {"text": "stability requires working to end", "start": 963.04, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "conflicts through negotiation in order", "start": 965.68, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "to secure a safe future and prevent", "start": 968.56, "duration": 6.76}, {"text": "future wars.", "start": 971.92, "duration": 3.4}, {"text": "Here", "start": 976.24, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "at the United Nations headquarters,", "start": 984.0, "duration": 4.12}, {"text": "there is a replica", "start": 989.04, "duration": 3.56}, {"text": "of the study of the Babylonian king", "start": 992.959, "duration": 5.041}, {"text": "Hamurabi.", "start": 995.6, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "It has an inscription which reads, \"Laws", "start": 998.0, "duration": 5.279}, {"text": "are made to prevent the strong from", "start": 1000.8, "duration": 6.12}, {"text": "oppressing the weak.", "start": 1003.279, "duration": 3.641}, {"text": "In today's world, we find the weak being", "start": 1007.519, "duration": 5.601}, {"text": "oppressed because it is the law of the", "start": 1010.399, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "powerful that governs, not the power of", "start": 1013.12, "duration": 5.8}, {"text": "the law.", "start": 1015.759, "duration": 3.161}, {"text": "Therefore, the question of Palestine", "start": 1019.68, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "remains central to any discussion of", "start": 1023.279, "duration": 6.68}, {"text": "stability in the region.", "start": 1026.16, "duration": 3.799}, {"text": "There will be no room for security in", "start": 1031.679, "duration": 4.321}, {"text": "the Middle East without a just solution", "start": 1033.76, "duration": 5.199}, {"text": "for this issue and without establishing", "start": 1036.0, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "the right of the Palestinian people to", "start": 1038.959, "duration": 4.801}, {"text": "their land,", "start": 1041.039, "duration": 4.481}, {"text": "to self-determination,", "start": 1043.76, "duration": 3.679}, {"text": "and to establishing their sovereign", "start": 1045.52, "duration": 4.919}, {"text": "state.", "start": 1047.439, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "We stress here the paramount importance", "start": 1053.2, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "of facilitating humanitarian access and", "start": 1055.52, "duration": 6.84}, {"text": "the protection of civilians.", "start": 1058.64, "duration": 3.72}, {"text": "Ladies and gentlemen,", "start": 1067.28, "duration": 3.639}, {"text": ">> the security we seek is not limited to", "start": 1071.76, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "halting conflicts, but rather includes", "start": 1073.919, "duration": 5.841}, {"text": "confronting climate change, the effects", "start": 1077.36, "duration": 7.4}, {"text": "of desertification and water scarcity.", "start": 1079.76, "duration": 5.0}, {"text": "These are challenges that Iraq faces", "start": 1085.44, "duration": 6.599}, {"text": "that affect its food security.", "start": 1087.84, "duration": 4.199}, {"text": "Therefore, we affirm that we hold", "start": 1092.64, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "steadfastly onto our just and legitimate", "start": 1095.039, "duration": 5.441}, {"text": "water rights and we call for the joint", "start": 1097.76, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "management of water resources in", "start": 1100.48, "duration": 4.079}, {"text": "accordance with the principles of", "start": 1102.799, "duration": 6.601}, {"text": "cooperation and international law.", "start": 1104.559, "duration": 4.841}, {"text": "In terms of risks, we continue to", "start": 1114.64, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "confront organized crime by cooperating", "start": 1117.44, "duration": 7.0}, {"text": "with all friends", "start": 1120.64, "duration": 3.8}, {"text": "to repel the dangers of organized crime", "start": 1124.64, "duration": 7.72}, {"text": "and to abort the crossber drug trade.", "start": 1127.28, "duration": 5.08}, {"text": "We call for more information sharing and", "start": 1133.28, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "international coordination to ward off", "start": 1135.84, "duration": 6.76}, {"text": "this danger that threatens societies.", "start": 1138.24, "duration": 4.36}, {"text": "Amid these challenges,", "start": 1143.039, "duration": 4.561}, {"text": "the well-being of the Iraqi people", "start": 1145.36, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "remains our ultimate objective and the", "start": 1147.6, "duration": 6.68}, {"text": "focus of all of our efforts.", "start": 1150.24, "duration": 4.04}, {"text": "Given the high proportion of young", "start": 1158.16, "duration": 5.759}, {"text": "people in our society,", "start": 1160.32, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "we seek to make them a true driving", "start": 1163.919, "duration": 4.481}, {"text": "force", "start": 1166.72, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "of the future economy.", "start": 1168.4, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "through education, the diversification", "start": 1172.32, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "of employment opportunities,", "start": 1174.72, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "support for entrepreneurship and the", "start": 1177.12, "duration": 6.28}, {"text": "advancement of digital economy.", "start": 1179.2, "duration": 4.2}, {"text": "At the same time, we remain committed in", "start": 1184.08, "duration": 4.959}, {"text": "accordance with the constitution to", "start": 1186.799, "duration": 4.401}, {"text": "protecting human rights and freedoms,", "start": 1189.039, "duration": 4.481}, {"text": "promoting women's participation,", "start": 1191.2, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "ensuring child welfare, and preserving", "start": 1193.52, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "the ethnic, religious, and cultural", "start": 1196.32, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "diversity of our country.", "start": 1198.48, "duration": 3.6}, {"text": "Ladies and gentlemen,", "start": 1207.039, "duration": 3.64}, {"text": "we confidently call upon you to engage", "start": 1211.919, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "more openly with Iraq", "start": 1214.32, "duration": 6.479}, {"text": "as it is a genuine partner capable of", "start": 1217.679, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "contributing to the promotion of", "start": 1220.799, "duration": 3.441}, {"text": "security,", "start": 1222.559, "duration": 4.561}, {"text": "the strengthening of stability", "start": 1224.24, "duration": 4.799}, {"text": "and the acceleration of development", "start": 1227.12, "duration": 5.799}, {"text": "across all sectors.", "start": 1229.039, "duration": 3.88}, {"text": "Today we say", "start": 1233.28, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "Iraq has never been on the margins.", "start": 1235.84, "duration": 6.079}, {"text": "Rather, it is the heart of history", "start": 1239.76, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "beating in the modern world.", "start": 1241.919, "duration": 6.081}, {"text": "Iraq is a nation worthy of partnership", "start": 1245.12, "duration": 7.16}, {"text": "as we move toward the future.", "start": 1248.0, "duration": 4.28}, {"text": "In conclusion, we reaffirm our support", "start": 1257.44, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "for the United Nations role and express", "start": 1261.039, "duration": 5.201}, {"text": "our appreciation for its efforts which", "start": 1264.0, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "have embodied collective action in", "start": 1266.24, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "support of Iraq through the United", "start": 1268.48, "duration": 4.559}, {"text": "Nations Assistance Mission for Iraq,", "start": 1270.88, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "Yunami, and we underscore our commitment", "start": 1273.039, "duration": 5.281}, {"text": "to fostering productive cooperation with", "start": 1276.08, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "the organization and wish it success in", "start": 1278.32, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "its endeavors to mitigate the effects of", "start": 1280.88, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "wars and the consequences of conflict", "start": 1283.2, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "around the world. May God's peace,", "start": 1285.84, "duration": 7.16}, {"text": "mercy, and blessings be upon you all.", "start": 1288.32, "duration": 4.68}, {"text": "On behalf of the assembly, I wish to", "start": 1298.96, "duration": 3.44}, {"text": "thank the prime minister of the Republic", "start": 1300.64, "duration": 4.919}, {"text": "of Iraq.", "start": 1302.4, "duration": 3.159}]